  "body": "Sitting pretty on the top floor within the sought-after Elementum development, this one-bedroom apartment combines modern design with effortless Long Bay living. This light and bright apartment welcomes you to your new lifestyle right next to the beach, walking tracks and all the amenities you desire.\r\n\r\nThe full-size bedroom comfortably accommodates a king bed, while the fully tiled bathroom features an oversized shower spanning the width of the room. A separate laundry cupboard, quality finishes, secure covered car park and west-facing aspect capturing warm afternoon sun complete the package.\r\n\r\n• Top floor apartment\r\n• Full-size bedroom suitable for a king bed\r\n• West-facing for afternoon sun\r\n• Fully tiled bathroom with oversized shower\r\n• Separate laundry cupboard\r\n• Secure covered car park\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a lock-and-leave lifestyle or a smart investment, this apartment offers an outstanding opportunity to secure a home in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Long Bay Village, cafes, supermarkets, walking tracks and the beach, everything you need is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today for more information or to organize a private viewing.",
